# Linear (RuleCloud)

MCP: official `linear` server in `.cursor/mcp.json` (`https://mcp.linear.app/mcp`). OAuth in Cursor MCP settings; optional `LINEAR_API_KEY` in env for scripts only.

## Teams

| Team | Key | Owns |
|------|-----|------|
| Integrations | `INT` | GitHub App/webhooks, third-party connectors |
| Platform | `PLT` | API, MCP, Supabase, Railway, guardrail engine |
| Product | `PRD` | Console, marketing site, onboarding UX |

Default template team `LEM` is deprecated—cancel onboarding issues after real teams exist.

## Priorities

Map work to Linear priority: **Urgent** (prod/security), **High** (integrations, blocking bugs), **Medium** (features), **Low** (chores/docs).

## GitHub

Link PRs/issues on Linear tickets (`attachment_url` or description). Primary repo: `lemonbanan4/rulecloud`.

## Example

Create High issue on Integrations: *Ship GitHub PR webhook v1* → link https://github.com/lemonbanan4/rulecloud/pull/1